        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sandy Fox, Tiggy, Mike Judge, Greg Daniels, Judy and Mary, Boomhauer\n- Works: King of the Hill, \"Freckles,\" \"Sobakasu,\" Rurouni Kenshin, \"Why\"\n- Roles: Voice actress, singer, dancer, fictional character\n\nFacts:\n- Sandy Fox was born on July 13, 1963.\n- Sandy Fox is an American voice actress, singer, and dancer.\n- Sandy Fox has had numerous roles in animated cartoons, anime, and video games.\n- King of the Hill is an American animated sitcom created by Mike Judge and Greg Daniels.\n- King of the Hill aired on Fox from January 12, 1997 to September 13, 2009.\n- Tiggy is perhaps best known for her remix of the Sandy Fox song \"Freckles.\"\n- \"Freckles\" was originally the English version of the song \"Sobakasu\" by Judy and Mary from the anime Rurouni Kenshin.\n- Tiggy is also popular in parts of Southeast Asia with the song \"Why.\"\n- Jeffrey Dexter \"Jeff\" Boomhauer III is commonly referred to as Boomhauer.\n- Boomhauer is a fictional character in the Fox animated series King of the Hill.",
